      ":question/id": "d9aff4b7-6deb-54f8-b755-a51550035d1e",
      ":question/problem": "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{5\\pi}{12}=\\frac{3\\pi}{4}-\\frac{\\pi}{3},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}",
